        "heading_size": 100,
        "content": "<p>Our exclusive linen fabric combines the elegance of natural linen with durability of performance materials for everyday dog use. This perfect balance of timeless luxury and practicality offers a soft, breathable feel while being resilient and long-lasting.</p><p><br/></p><ul><li><h5>Effortlessly Stylish & Practical</h5></li><li><h5>Breathable + Temperature Regulating</h5></li><li><h5>Thick, Durable & Scratch-resistant</h5></li><li><h5>Stays Naturally Fresh</h5></li></ul>",
